<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Camden Property started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Camden Property started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney started coverage of Camden Property Trust with an outperform rating, the office of the analyst confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares unchanged at 25-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
